# WiChat

Self-hosted AGPL team chat with plugins. **Source of truth:** `docs/architecture/wichat-system-design.md`.

## Stack (fixed for v1)

Go monorepo microservices + LiveKit + Postgres/Redis/ES/MinIO/Kafka; Next.js web/PWA, Electron, RN Android.

## When implementing

- Match phased roadmap (§15); do not build deferred non-goals (federation, E2E, SaaS multi-tenant, marketplace).
- Plugins: separate process, permission manifest, gRPC to core; heavy UX in plugin UI (iframe/postMessage).
- Prefer boring ops: `docker compose`, single-tenant instance, 2–500 users/workspace without sharding.
- Production quality: tests at trust boundaries, rate limits, no secrets in git.

## Repo layout target

`backend/`, `frontend/`, `deploy/`, `docs/` — do not add parallel top-level app folders.
